{"id":"swiss-typographic","title":"Swiss — Typographic Grid","description":"International Typographic Style — a strict 12-column grid, Helvetica, one red accent and zero decoration. The timeless granddaddy of minimal design; press G to reveal the grid the page is built on.","tags":["swiss","typographic","grid"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:10:09.986Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Swiss — Typographic Grid\ndescription: International Typographic Style — a strict 12-column grid, Helvetica, one red accent and zero decoration. The timeless granddaddy of minimal design; press G to reveal the grid the page is built on.\ntags: [swiss, typographic, grid]\norder: 17\n---\n\n# Swiss — Typographic Grid\n\nInternational Typographic Style: mathematical grid, neutral type, objective photography\nspace and exactly one accent colour. Order is the aesthetic.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Paper | `#ffffff` |\n| Ink | `#111` · secondary `#777` |\n| Accent | `#e30613` swiss red — one element at a time |\n| Type | \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial — headlines 700 tight, labels 11px uppercase +0.18em |\n| Grid | 12 columns, 24px gutter — press **G** to reveal it |\n\n## Structure\n\nSpec-sheet masthead → oversized lowercase display with a red full stop → three objective\ntext columns → numbered index (01–04) with hairline rules → coordinates footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Swiss — Typographic Grid\n\nInternational Typographic Style: mathematical grid, neutral type, objective photography\nspace and exactly one accent colour. Order is the aesthetic.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Paper | `#ffffff` |\n| Ink | `#111` · secondary `#777` |\n| Accent | `#e30613` swiss red — one element at a time |\n| Type | \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial — headlines 700 tight, labels 11px uppercase +0.18em |\n| Grid | 12 columns, 24px gutter — press **G** to reveal it |\n\n## Structure\n\nSpec-sheet masthead → oversized lowercase display with a red full stop → three objective\ntext columns → numbered index (01–04) with hairline rules → coordinates footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>grid. — Swiss Typographic\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: #111; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; }\n  .label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111; font-weight: 500; }\n  .mut { color: #777; }\n\n  .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #111; }\n  .hero { padding: 80px 0 70px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: end; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(64px, 12vw, 150px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: 0.9; }\n  h1 .dot { color: #e30613; }\n  .redsq { width: 110px; height: 110px; background: #e30613; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .spec { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; padding: 26px 0 60px; }\n  .spec .cell { border-top: 1px solid #111; padding-top: 12px; }\n  .spec .cell .label { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .spec .cell p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #333; }\n\n  .index { border-top: 2px solid #111; }\n  .ix { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: baseline; padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; transition: padding-left 0.2s; cursor: default; }\n  .ix:hover { padding-left: 12px; }\n  .ix:hover .no { color: #e30613; }\n  .ix .no { font-size: 54px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; transition: color 0.2s; }\n  .ix h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .ix p { font-size: 13px; color: #777; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .ix .yr { font-size: 12px; color: #777; }\n\n  .grid-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90; pointer-events: none; display: none; }\n  body.show-grid .grid-overlay { display: block; }\n  .grid-overlay .inner { max-width: 1040px; height: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .grid-overlay .col { background: rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.07); border-left: 1px solid rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.25); border-right: 1px solid rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.25); }\n\n  .tip { margin: 20px 0 60px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; }\n  .tip kbd { border: 1px solid #bbb; border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 7px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 11px; background: #f6f6f6; }\n  footer { border-top: 2px solid #111; margin-top: 20px; }\n  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 16px; padding-bottom: 40px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #777; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 720px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .spec { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ix { grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; } .ix .yr { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"grid-overlay\">\u003cdiv class=\"inner\">\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"meta\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">International Typographic Style\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"label mut\">Zürich · 1957 / 2026\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"hero\">\n      \u003ch1>grid\u003cspan class=\"dot\">.\u003c/span>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"redsq\">\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"spec\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Objective\u003c/span>\u003cp>Design is not art. Design is order in service of information. Every element sits where the grid says it must.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Method\u003c/span>\u003cp>One typeface. One accent. Twelve columns. Reduce until nothing false remains, then reduce once more.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Result\u003c/span>\u003cp>A page that reads the same in 1957 and 2026 — because clarity never goes out of fashion.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"index\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">01\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Typography is the grid\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Set the type correctly and the layout designs itself.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1957\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">02\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>White space is structure\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Emptiness carries as much information as ink.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1962\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">03\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Red, used once\u003c/h3>\u003cp>A single accent earns attention; a dozen loses it.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1968\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">04\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Neutral, not boring\u003c/h3>\u003cp>The designer disappears so the content can appear.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">2026\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cp class=\"tip\">Press \u003ckbd>G\u003c/kbd> to reveal the 12-column grid this page is built on.\u003c/p>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan>grid. — helvetica nowhere studio\u003c/span>\u003cspan>47.3769° N, 8.5417° E\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    addEventListener(\"keydown\", e => {\n      if ((e.key === \"g\" || e.key === \"G\") && !/INPUT|TEXTAREA/.test(document.activeElement.tagName)) {\n        document.body.classList.toggle(\"show-grid\");\n      }\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>grid. — Swiss Typographic\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: #111; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; }\n  .label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111; font-weight: 500; }\n  .mut { color: #777; }\n\n  .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #111; }\n  .hero { padding: 80px 0 70px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: end; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(64px, 12vw, 150px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: 0.9; }\n  h1 .dot { color: #e30613; }\n  .redsq { width: 110px; height: 110px; background: #e30613; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .spec { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; padding: 26px 0 60px; }\n  .spec .cell { border-top: 1px solid #111; padding-top: 12px; }\n  .spec .cell .label { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .spec .cell p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #333; }\n\n  .index { border-top: 2px solid #111; }\n  .ix { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: baseline; padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; transition: padding-left 0.2s; cursor: default; }\n  .ix:hover { padding-left: 12px; }\n  .ix:hover .no { color: #e30613; }\n  .ix .no { font-size: 54px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; transition: color 0.2s; }\n  .ix h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .ix p { font-size: 13px; color: #777; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .ix .yr { font-size: 12px; color: #777; }\n\n  .grid-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90; pointer-events: none; display: none; }\n  body.show-grid .grid-overlay { display: block; }\n  .grid-overlay .inner { max-width: 1040px; height: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .grid-overlay .col { background: rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.07); border-left: 1px solid rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.25); border-right: 1px solid rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.25); }\n\n  .tip { margin: 20px 0 60px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; }\n  .tip kbd { border: 1px solid #bbb; border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 7px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 11px; background: #f6f6f6; }\n  footer { border-top: 2px solid #111; margin-top: 20px; }\n  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 16px; padding-bottom: 40px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #777; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 720px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .spec { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ix { grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; } .ix .yr { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"grid-overlay\">\u003cdiv class=\"inner\">\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"col\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"meta\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">International Typographic Style\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"label mut\">Zürich · 1957 / 2026\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"hero\">\n      \u003ch1>grid\u003cspan class=\"dot\">.\u003c/span>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"redsq\">\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"spec\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Objective\u003c/span>\u003cp>Design is not art. Design is order in service of information. Every element sits where the grid says it must.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Method\u003c/span>\u003cp>One typeface. One accent. Twelve columns. Reduce until nothing false remains, then reduce once more.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cell\">\u003cspan class=\"label\">Result\u003c/span>\u003cp>A page that reads the same in 1957 and 2026 — because clarity never goes out of fashion.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"index\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">01\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Typography is the grid\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Set the type correctly and the layout designs itself.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1957\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">02\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>White space is structure\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Emptiness carries as much information as ink.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1962\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">03\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Red, used once\u003c/h3>\u003cp>A single accent earns attention; a dozen loses it.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">1968\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ix\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">04\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch3>Neutral, not boring\u003c/h3>\u003cp>The designer disappears so the content can appear.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"yr\">2026\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cp class=\"tip\">Press \u003ckbd>G\u003c/kbd> to reveal the 12-column grid this page is built on.\u003c/p>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan>grid. — helvetica nowhere studio\u003c/span>\u003cspan>47.3769° N, 8.5417° E\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    addEventListener(\"keydown\", e => {\n      if ((e.key === \"g\" || e.key === \"G\") && !/INPUT|TEXTAREA/.test(document.activeElement.tagName)) {\n        document.body.classList.toggle(\"show-grid\");\n      }\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}